WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.465
Profile holds your account name and password controls.

00:00:04.515 --> 00:00:07.513
The sign-in email is shown for reference.

00:00:07.563 --> 00:00:13.014
To change your password, enter the current password and the new one twice.

00:00:13.064 --> 00:00:16.880
Saving a new password signs out your other sessions.
